  "notes": "Two-storey ochre/mustard render house (#d9b855) with an orange terracotta gable roof (#bf5a33) and a smaller terracotta lean-to roof over the timber-pergola entrance porch. Windows are narrow with deep-blue glass (#3f4a86) and white frames; a wall AC unit sits above the porch. Frontage is dominated by a tall matte-black solid metal sliding gate with three small white vent panels; a fruit tree (red/pink berries) and potted plant to the right, a white municipal noticeboard cabinet (event poster, '40') and a green wheelie bin at the kerb (props pending). Sampled colours 2026-07-04."
